# Project Title: Turtle Graphics

## Description

This folder has a main script that is used to create a program which illustrates how the turtle library works

### Dependencies

Mandatory: 

KEY POINTS:
1. The draw_shapes file draws a shape with as many sides as you want. I chose a triangle, square, octagon, pentagon, decagon etc.
2. The random_walk.py creates a graphic which appears as if the turtle is taking a walk randomly across the canvas.
3. The "circle.py" program makes a Spirograph using a heading change you describe and then stopspippip .
4. The questions are selected at random and every try.

### Installations Needed

turtle library
random library

